# Duplicator player-facing copy
tooltip.rfgen.more=Hold Shift for details
tooltip.rfgen.wormhole_duplicator.summary=1 diamond nugget + 1 item → 2 of that item
tooltip.rfgen.wormhole_duplicator.detail.1=Consumes the template each craft.
tooltip.rfgen.wormhole_duplicator.detail.2=Fuel: diamond nugget (Thermal Foundation or nuggetDiamond).
tooltip.rfgen.wormhole_duplicator.detail.3=Rejects NBT items and blacklisted mod machines/resources.
tooltip.rfgen.wormhole_duplicator.detail.4=Reusable — keeps crafting while fuel, template, and output space remain.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_duplicator.summary=1 diamond + 1 item → 2 of that item (once)
