tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_duplicator.detail.2=Fuel: one full diamond.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_duplicator.detail.3=After crafting, contents drop and the block becomes Unstable Naquadah.
tooltip.rfgen.unstable_wormhole_duplicator.detail.4=Same template rules as the stable duplicator (no NBT / blacklist).

